ials. Further, the company offers engineering materials, such as construction chemicals comprising a range of resinous construction chemicals for industrial floorings, protective coatings, structural repairs, waterproofing, adhesives, and sealants, as well as specialty epoxy and polyurethane anti-microbial floorings and wall coating systems; and reactive polyamides used in epoxy resins to produce top coats and primers, as well as thermosetting adhesives for a various substrates. The company was incorporated in 1956 and is headquartered in Pune, India. ELANTAS Beck India Limited is a subsidiary of ELANTAS GmbH.","employees":204,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1777939200,"asOf":1795774605},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795774605,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"ELANTAS Beck India\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Elantas Beck Trader Analysis | StockIQ","s":"The Economic Times","d":1794944247,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOdHdabGVQTVllRVpSVWdWNDN6YUNORVRjT2ttaG56d1h4eGVER0ZlYlh5ME1WeVU3MmJ5ZWFtR0plWmlFNnU4aGdXTkliTFctZzg2bkZlblpsT2lVVjVsTkJXM2RQaGxNTzlRR29pZjFWeWNXTU5kZzZiRE1IRnFpRzBfQ3luQktCT3gyc0hmbHAtQQ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"ELANTAS Beck India Limited Appoints CA Supriya Bansal as Chief Financial Officer","s":"https://hrtoday.in/","d":1793424258,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNaEZJX25ucUNMalRzZ2dVeUh5LUpfSEdrTmg4UkNLazRvaVBBUExjc3IyNzhsYnBPSTZJMUJublNWbnJyekFzdEdZTHJGNklXcVZ6MUd4LTdqcUVRODBrT2F4dmRvYkVHZjNhQjRXaXktNDJQV2NxMHdRSmlVZmxUSmNjNzh4OHFNcGtZUVJRdkFGbUtyUWV0aTJpWEhDWTVoU1E?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Karamtara Engineering Appoints Puneet Mathur as Business Head (Senior Vice President) – PEB Business","s":"https://hrtoday.in/","d":1793423816,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQNXgxMjNYWGlDVE9GdVgyWGFITmNHcWxtMkJhMkQ2cThsQTNyUUVZTXUyc3AwN2ExVm5oODJQcDZNcE1ibHB5UGJjNUczanlGc21XcHpYdmhtXzNpZERUanFmX3NQbXNubjc1VHBMMGpxczJ